                                "example_id": "e6fe901e-a135-4ac4-93cb-25c0a6a9a6f9",
                                "sense_id": "a23fa9be-a33e-3a2c-8de3-58ac8e0610af",
                                "text": "“No. Not quite a month.—It is only four weeks to-morrow since I left Mansfield.”\n“You are a most accurate and honest reckoner. I should call that a month.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4385cd66-e785-419b-9c17-763311cb656c",
                                "sense_id": "a23fa9be-a33e-3a2c-8de3-58ac8e0610af",
                                "text": "middle-aged (-ajd), between youth and old age, variously reckoned to suit the reckoner"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c78487c-812e-47e6-a688-4de63296a4dc",
                                "sense_id": "a23fa9be-a33e-3a2c-8de3-58ac8e0610af",
                                "text": "Some experienced New York political reckoners think the real race, in the end, will be between Democrat Richard Ottinger and Mr. Buckley."
